  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/6dc0b003-8748-4fe2-9328-dbd30c2567ed-image.png\" style=\"width: 328px; height: 230px;\" /></p><p>Let speed of boat is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>u</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>/</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></math> and height of tower<br />is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>h</mi></math> meter &amp; distance <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi></math> metre</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>hcot</mi><mn>30</mn><mo>&#176;</mo><mo>-</mo><mi>hcot</mi><mn>45</mn><mo>&#176;</mo></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>h</mi><mo>(</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">u</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mn>20</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi><mo>(</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo></mrow><mn>20</mn></mfrac><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>/</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo></math> Time taken to travel from <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi></math> to <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>C</mi></math> (Distance<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mi>h</mi></math> meter)</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">u</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi><mfrac><mrow><mo>(</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo></mrow><mn>20</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>20</mn><mrow><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>(</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo><mi>sec</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo></math></p>",
